=== IMPORTANT: this repository is not wholly the author's work ==============

The notice above covers only the parts the author wrote. The repository also
contains material derived from third parties, kept here solely for private,
local, non-commercial development and play. The author does not own it, cannot
license it, and no one may redistribute it:

  * Anime characters, names, likenesses, quotes and related material, owned by
    their respective rights holders (Shueisha, Shogakukan, Nintendo / The
    Pokémon Company, and others).

  * Content derived from an unauthorized Warcraft III custom map, which is
    itself an unlicensed derivative work by an unknown author — so two
    separate layers of other people's rights apply to it.

  * Assets extracted from Warcraft III, © Blizzard Entertainment, Inc.
    Blizzard's terms prohibit redistributing them. In this project they are
    gated to loopback/LAN environments and are not served publicly.

  * Third-party licensed assets that carry their own terms and attribution
    requirements (including a CC BY 4.0 model that requires visible credit,
    and sound effects with use restrictions). Required credits are being
    tracked separately as an open task; they are an obligation regardless of
    this repository staying private.

Consequences that follow from the above, stated plainly:

  * Do not make this repository public.
  * Do not deploy it on a publicly reachable network.
  * Do not publish releases, builds, or asset packs from it.

Any of those would distribute the third-party material listed above.

If you were given access to contribute: you are working on someone else's
private project. Contributions are made for use within this project only, and
nothing here grants you rights over the third-party material.

This file records intent and provenance. It is not legal advice.
